@startuml fig4-4-gateway-state
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam dpi 150
skinparam ArrowColor #A80036
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #FEFECE
  BorderColor #A80036
  FontColor #000000
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFF3C4
  BorderColor #A80036
}

state "等待 Identify\n(AWAITING_IDENTIFY)" as awaiting
state "识别中\n(IDENTIFYING)" as identifying
state "就绪\n(READY)" as ready
state "断线\n(DISCONNECTED)" as disconnected
state "恢复中\n(RESUMING)" as resuming

[*] --> awaiting : 建立 WebSocket (/ws)\n服务端下发 OP10 Hello\n(heartbeat_interval = 41250ms)
awaiting --> identifying : 客户端发送 OP2 Identify\n(携带 JWT)
identifying --> ready : 令牌校验通过\n下发 READY 事件
identifying --> [*] : 令牌无效\nOP9 Invalid Session
ready --> ready : OP1 Heartbeat / OP11 Heartbeat ACK\n间隔 41.25s
ready --> disconnected : 连接异常关闭 / OP7 Reconnect
disconnected --> resuming : 30s 窗口内发送 OP6 Resume\n(token + session_id)
resuming --> ready : 恢复成功\n下发 RESUMED 事件
resuming --> disconnected : 恢复失败\nOP9 Invalid Session
disconnected --> identifying : 会话缓存过期\n重新 Identify

note right of ready
  · 服务端 125s 未收到心跳 → 关闭连接踢线
  · 会话在断线后于 CacheService 保留 30s 供 Resume
end note

note bottom
  · 客户端指数退避重连：1s → 2s → 4s → … → 上限 30s
  · close 4004 / 4005（认证失败）不重连，直接上报 AUTH_FAILED
  · 连续 3 次未收到 Heartbeat ACK 触发自愈：重建连接并重新 Identify
end note
@enduml
